# Artificial Evolution changes the text of Sphinx's Approach on the stack, Sphinx to Elf (CR 612.1): the search then finds an
# Elf creature card, not a Sphinx, even though the spell has been exiled by then (its words are last-known, CR 400.7).
# Emry mills the four copies on turn one; on turn three the Approach is cast with Island, Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet, then
# Artificial Evolution with the Black Lotus. Sphinx of the Guildpact is refused, Llanowar Elves is found.

